india.indiatimes.com/photo/135116652.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Akhilesh Yadav met Azam Khan in Rampur district jail as the Samajwadi Party prepares for upcoming elections. Yadav accused the BJP government of targeting Khan's family with false cases and political vendetta. During their meeting, they discussed strategies for all 403 Assembly constituencies, gathering input from alliance partners. The SP leader emphasized the importance of justice and fairness in Rampur while planning to fulfill Khan's vision for education.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-political-family-faced-as-much-injustice-akhilesh-meets-jailed-azam-khan-targets-bjp/articleshow/135116652.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-political-family-faced-as-much-injustice-akhilesh-meets-jailed-azam-khan-targets-bjp/articleshow/135116652.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-22T16:20:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135116681,imgsize-976266.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Inconsistent with policy’: Bikaner House on removal of photos from Raihan Vadra’s exhibition]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/inconsistent-with-policy-bikaner-house-on-removal-of-photos-from-raihan-vadras-exhibition/articleshow/135116229.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135116229.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/inconsistent-with-policy-bikaner-house-on-removal-of-photos-from-raihan-vadras-exhibition/articleshow/135116229.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/inconsistent-with-policy-bikaner-house-on-removal-of-photos-from-raihan-vadras-exhibition/articleshow/135116229.cms]]></g